<title>HONG KONG: Arthur Andersen names managing partner for Beijing.</title>
<headline>Arthur Andersen names managing partner for Beijing.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Accounting and consulting firm Arthur Andersen said on Monday it had appointed Bryan Henderson as managing partner of its Beijing's office.</p>
<p>Henderson will also be chief executive of Authur Andersen-Hua Qiang, a joint venture with China's Ministry of Finance.</p>
<p>Henderson previously served as managing partner of Arthur Andersen's Vancouver office, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
